      "mergeID": "6639a8feec7160347bede0a5",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Greetings, Leader of Bunny Squad here.\n\nOver the years my community has made several maps.\n\nWe would love to have a way to display them all in our vrc group. \n\nIt's also a great way for people to learn about us - be seeing our maps. \n\nLet those with sufficient permissions assign favorite maps for the group. \n\nThis should extend to any map in the game - as maybe there will be groups that don't so much make maps themselves, but maybe frequent a few game worlds or have a favorite chill zone or want to favorite a nice auditorium or meeting room map.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1270] Group's Favorite Worlds",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "6388409cfbdc534ee47342f1",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I will add that this is a win-win feature for communities, map makers, and the general playerbase as this is a great form of exposure for both worlds and communities.\n\n(By extension it's also a way for us to showcase the avatars of our community, which we put in our worlds.)\n\nMaps could also have some kind of statistic like, \"Map featured in 3 communities.\"\n\nFor groups, players would also be able to more easily find fellow group members in instances of the listed maps.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
